INT. NORTH VALE OFFICE/WORKROOM - DAY

PRIYA at North Vale receives the neutral inquiry for case H09-55216. The underlying case exists. The supposed supplemental authority cannot be found, and the power it claims does not match the real order. Priya opens an independent file and sends a bounded written answer.

Vale lays dispatch, placement and review dates beside it. One destination appears prepared before the purported authority existed. Zoe keeps the authenticated source with that timeline.

Mac and Cain hear that someone outside their channels has asked the question. An independent record now exists that neither controls.

ZOE
We can say this part. Base case real. Supplement missing. Claimed power disputed. The rest stays a question.
